{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2021-10-21 15:36:00', 'title': 'WALMART AND WALMART.ORG INCREASE ACCESS TO EDUCATIONAL OPPORTUNITIES FOR BLACK AND AFRICAN AMERICANS', 'text': "BENTONVILLE, ARK.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WALMART INC. (NYSE: WMT) AND WALMART.ORG TODAY ANNOUNCED A TRIO OF ADDITIONAL SHARED VALUE AND PHILANTHROPIC INITIATIVES THAT BUILD ON ITS STRATEGY TO ADVANCE EQUITY IN EDUCATION, INCLUDING: THREE LEADING HISTORICALLY BLACK COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITIES (HBCUS) - MOREHOUSE COLLEGE, NORTH CAROLINA A&T STATE UNIVERSITY AND SPELMAN COLLEGE - WILL BE ADDED TO THE SLATE OF WALMART'S LIVE BETTER U (LBU) ACADEMIC PARTNERS, IN PARTNERSHIP WITH GUILD EDUCATION. THROUG"}